WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.400
- Oh my God, I love your outfit!

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.233
- Thank you.

00:00:03.233 --> 00:00:05.037
- Those are the pants I
love 'cause you can just go

00:00:05.037 --> 00:00:06.548
(blows raspberry) and they're off.

00:00:06.548 --> 00:00:07.590
- (laughs) You can.

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:08.535
- Yeah, those are the button ones, right?

00:00:08.535 --> 00:00:09.368
(Seal makes air whooshing noise)

00:00:09.368 --> 00:00:10.230
Those are the, yeah.

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:11.880
You know, like the
button ones on the sides,

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:12.713
like when you play sports.

00:00:12.713 --> 00:00:15.048
Anyway, I love those, it's
nice to see you again.

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:15.881
- Nice to see you again, yeah.

00:00:15.881 --> 00:00:17.220
- We haven't seen each other,

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:18.750
I think we met and we were doing something

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.277
with David Foster for Indy-

00:00:20.277 --> 00:00:21.930
- That was it, something he roped us into.

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:23.550
- He did, yeah, and we showed up, but we,

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:25.200
it was a race situation

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.690
that we both knew a lot about. (chuckles)

00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:29.200
- Can you remember song we were singing?

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.410
What? What were we singing?

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:33.060
- I don't, it was it?

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:34.530
It wasn't like the "Star Spangled Banner"

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:35.453
or anything, was it?

00:00:35.453 --> 00:00:36.360
- No.

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:37.251
- No? It wasn't something-

00:00:37.251 --> 00:00:38.790
- Something, was it? Oh.

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:40.560
- 'Cause they do that
at some of those events.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:41.700
- It was good fun though.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:43.680
- We totally, it was
memorable for both of us,

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:45.260
we can't remember what we sang. (laughs)

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:46.170
(audience laughing)

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:50.820
It was so long ago, I mean,
like, probably 2004 or 2005.

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:52.940
- Yeah, probably at least-
- Yeah.

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:54.810
- At least 16, 17 years ago.

00:00:54.810 --> 00:00:56.220
- Yeah, it was a while back.

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:57.930
Anyway, your voice is incredible.

00:00:57.930 --> 00:00:58.763
I was so honored-
- Oh, thank you.

00:00:58.763 --> 00:00:59.596
- To get to sing with you.

00:00:59.596 --> 00:01:01.980
I love, there's people that can sing,

00:01:01.980 --> 00:01:02.820
like, I feel like I'm a singer,

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:04.560
but you have, you're like a stylist.

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:05.393
You have that tone

00:01:05.393 --> 00:01:06.960
that everybody recognizes
right off the bat.

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:07.950
You know, it's so special.

00:01:07.950 --> 00:01:09.533
- Oh, you're not so bad yourself.

